    "findings": [
      "21m-4 projected receiver, yellow selected light at left and four gray light pillars show a fixed-budget ray and moving orange contribution. Narration caveat covers complex occlusion, noise and history ghosts; no constant-quality guarantee as lights increase.",
      "21m-5 direct yellow light-to-first-surface arrow and indirect teal first-to-second-surface arrow grow separately. Surface edges retain depth. MegaLights direct and Lumen indirect roles are distinguished without claiming exact indirect transport from a single direct feature switch.",
      "21m-6 stylized green leaves/orange trunk and teal voxel-like boxes change visibility. 2025 UE5.7 experimental Nanite Foliage label marks a geometry-representation extension, not a new GI algorithm. These are explanation pixels; actual Foliage native acquisition/viewing remains pending and older Nanite city footage does not prove this feature.",
      "16-pre-direct-versus-transparent light, two layered surfaces and camera have visible projected edges. Yellow light paths advance separately, then teal front-to-back camera traversal grows. This bridges older transparency problems into the current pipeline without dating transparency after MegaLights.",
      "Frame848 remains21m-4/84921m-5,169821m-5/169921m-6,260721m-6/2608bridge; last3534 remains bridge. All12boards45samples directly read. Black background, white text/yellow headings; no text corruption or diagram crop seen in these samples. Clean source excludes narration captions. Continuous-motion/final pixels remain unapproved."
    ],
